"A census of your own cards and tags: what a tag tells any reader, read whole and kept only on this screen. Nothing is written, emulated, or cloned — iOS allows this app no such role, and the census asks for none." = "你自己的卡与标签普查：一个标签会告诉任何读取者什么，完整读出，只留在这块屏幕上。不是为了复制。";
"A chest dresses the whole house — Send, Serve, Recon, stealth — in one tap. Applying loads configuration only; it starts nothing." = "一个宝箱可以一键为整座房子装扮——Send、Serve、Recon、隐身。应用它会加载配置，并可选择启动宝箱指明的内容。没有宝箱的话什么都不会启动，EMCON 仍然会否决条件禁止的东西。";
"A coin is claimed" = "一枚硬币被认领";
"A console, not a terminal: open the socket, send lines, watch what comes back. Binary replies print as hexdumps." = "一个控制台，不是终端：打开套接字，发送行，看返回什么。二进制回复以十六进制打印；长度守卫可以实时切换。";
"A costume sets the name the beacon and the GATT host wear. Live organs restart wearing it, with the name as their greeting. A name you type is kept on your own rack — swipe it away to clear it." = "一套服装决定信标和GATT主机穿戴的名字。活的器官穿着它重启，旧身份先被收起——宣告与监听者——然后新的才启动。";
"A cryptographer who would rather make a thing than explain it. You're holding the evidence." = "一位宁愿做东西也不愿解释的密码学家。证据就在你手里。";
"A dossier for everyone who has knocked — assembled from the tripwire log this phone keeps. It covers what the log still holds." = "为每一个敲过门的人建的档案——由这部电话保存的绊线日志拼装而成。它记录的是那台设备对这部电话做过什么，而不是它对世界做过什么。";
"A duel is offered" = "有人发起决斗";
"A file is sealed in chunks under one random key; the protection you choose is only how that key is kept — by a password (PBKDF2), by this device's vault key, by either, by both together (each holds half the secret), or sealed to a recipient's public key for a dead-drop hand-off. The original filename travels inside the encryption, and the finished file is filed in Deliveries, ready to send by any road. Opening restores the file under its own name." = "一个文件在一把随机密钥下分块封存；你选择的保护只是这把密钥的保管方式——一个包裹它的密码（PBKDF2–HMAC–SHA256，600,000 轮，每次新盐——重用密码能保持它密封，但不能保护你免受别处的离线暴力破解）、房子的宝箱钥匙、二者选一，或两者都需要。死信单独来：一把一次性 P-256 密钥随文件旅行，封印可以在没有其他秘密的情况下打开，所以它的强度在于加密本身，而不是秘密。";
"A listener. A knocker. A keeper of lists." = "一个监听者。一个敲门者。一个清单的守护者。";
"A message locked by repeated squaring, in the Magic Box manner: the sealer forges two primes, slips through the φ shortcut, and throws the factors away. After that, the only road in is the grind — sequential, unparallelizable, calibrated to this phone's pace. A lock delays; it does not schedule: anyone holding the capsule can start grinding now, and faster hardware finishes sooner. Carry the capsule by any means — the lock travels with it." = "一条用重复平方锁住的消息，魔盒的方式：封印者锻造两个素数，把消息密钥塞到它们下面，并给出一个工作因子——默认1,200轮，大致是那把锁向封印者瞄准的人索要的代价。它越接近你的耐心就越强：太便宜，攻击只是一笔小买卖；太贵，你自己也永远打不开。";
"A nearby phone is selected — the address is ignored until you tap it." = "附近有一台电话被选中——在你点它之前，地址会被忽略。";
"A new epoch empties the registry and the timeline. Nothing is stitched across the line — an emitter heard again is a new record, by design." = "新的纪元会清空注册表与时间线。不会跨线拼接——再次听到的发射者会被当作陌生人，这才对。";
"A new name every" = "每隔 ";
"A newer nightjar is out. This release has no over-the-air build, so it installs the Xcode way — open the project and press Run. Your logs are kept." = "有更新的 nightjar 发布了。此版本没有无线安装包，因此按 Xcode 的方式安装——打开项目并点 Run。您的日志会保留。";
"A packet walks into a bar. No ports open. It leaves. That's the joke. That's networking." = "一个数据包走进酒吧。没有开放的端口。它离开了。这就是笑话。这就是网络。";
"A payload your own gear sent you, kept as a button: the bytes join the book, and the button aims back at the house they came from. Set the port in the editor before you fire it." = "一份你自己的设备发给你的载荷，存成一个按钮：字节加入书中，按钮瞄准回发送者。在战争中，库和刀刃获得一层外国皮肤——一位外国哨兵曾经说过的脉冲，被返回成为可读探针可用。";
"A persona answers whoever knocks, in character, and files everything they say into the inbox as one transcript. One canary at a time, and it cannot share a port with the tripwire or Serve. Honeydrop is the activate phase beyond answering: the persona carries a prize — a bait file, a published message, a receipt, a key exchange — and a prober who takes it is journaled on the spot." = "一个人格以角色身份回应敲门者，并把他们说的一切作为一次交换存进收件箱。每个伪装都带自己的：货架上的通用形态、借来的名字下这个应用诚实的签名、以及我家的档案。";
"A persona dresses the whole device as a class of thing: the air name, the greeting, and Serve's listeners and replies, all in character. Dropping the shape restores the dress it found — ports, replies, name and all." = "一种人格把整台设备装扮成一类事物：空中的名字、问候、Serve 的监听与回复，全都入戏。卸下形态，就会恢复它找到的装束——端口、回复、名字，一切如旧。";
"A quiet twelve hours. Nothing knocked that mattered." = "安静的十二个小时。没有值得在意的敲门。";
"A real query over UDP, answers parsed locally — the grown-up version of the library's DNS seed." = "通过 UDP 的真正查询，答案在本地解析——是库里 DNS 种子的成人版。";
"A route, walked hop by hop. Each line is a stop: a target, a range, host:80,443 (a port train), or a bare host (a train across the usual ports). Chain sends each hop the previous hop's reply; Seed sends the step-2 payload everywhere. The phone makes every send, out and back — nothing is left behind on any target." = "一条路线，一跳一跳地走。每行是一站：一个目标、一个范围、host:80,443（一列端口列车），或一个裸端口。# 以及其后的一切都是注释。";
"A run does exactly what these blocks say, in order. Waits hold the list; a block that cannot run stops the run and says why — in the run log and the night log." = "一次运行严格地按照这些块所说的顺序执行。等待会保持列表；无法运行的块会停止运行并说明。";
"A shape is a class, never a specific device — the rack's line holds for your own cloth too." = "形态是一个类别，永远不是某个具体设备——架子的规矩对你自己的布也适用。";
"A sweep would settle me. I want to know who's lying out there." = "扫一遍我就能安心。我想知道外面谁在撒谎。";
"A switch humming at 2 a.m. Nothing else is close." = "凌晨两点一台交换机在嗡嗡响。附近没有别的了。";
"A watch officer under a charter you write. OBSERVE: it assesses and files proposals, and touches nothing. ACT: it runs plans in proportion to confidence — high runs the whole plan, medium its first step, low is journaled and left to you. FULL: it may also approve its own drafted reflexes and raise EMCON at your usual hour. Every judgment is a sealed journal line with its score and its factors; you audit it, you amend the charter. It thinks while the app is open — every opening is a shift change." = "一位按你所写宪章行事的值守官。观察：评估并提交建议，什么都不动。学习：记录你网络的习惯——安静时段、常客的节奏、日常断裂的脚步。行动：凭借你预先写好的宪章，按这些规则自行干预。干预受干预算限制（默认每天 4 次），主开关仍在 EMCON 中。";
"A watch records the registry and the timeline under a name, then files itself with its delta: what arrived, what went silent, what changed." = "一次值守将注册表和时间线记在一个名字下，然后连同它的增量一起归档：什么来了，什么走了，哪些端口变了，哪些名字今天已经出现过两次。";
"A wire at night, honest and busy." = "夜晚的一条线，诚实而忙碌。";
