"BTHome v1 is the legacy generation of the BTHome sensor format. Its encryption carries no replay protection — a captured v1 advertisement can be replayed verbatim and accepted — so the house decodes v1 only when you switch it on here, and only ever reads it: nothing in the app acts on a v1 reading. BTHome v2 is unaffected and always decoded." = "BTHome v1 是 BTHome 传感器格式的旧一代。其加密没有重放保护——捕获的 v1 广播可以原样重放并被接受——因此房子只在您在此处打开时才解码 v1，且只读取：应用中的任何功能都不会根据 v1 的读数采取行动。BTHome v2 不受影响，始终解码。";
