"Connects to each port and speaks the protocol that port expects. A star means the reply carried the protocol's own tell — the port answered as that service, not merely opened. Tap a hit to load it into Send." = "连接每个端口，并说那个端口期待的协议。星号意味着回复带着那个服务自己的标记。";
