"Correlation over this phone's own tripwire log: shared habits suggest, they never prove. Two tenants of one NAT can share every trait here and still be strangers." = "基于这部电话自己的绊线日志的相关性：共同的习惯只能提示，永远不能证明。同一个 NAT 后面的两个住户可能看起来像一个人。打包只做到共同的时段为止，不再往前。";
"Costumes dress this device in generic shapes; its own addresses stay its own. Nothing here copies a real device's identity, clones an advertisement the ear has heard, or plants a fake tracker — a wardrobe, not a forgery kit." = "伪装给这台设备穿上通用形状；它自己的地址仍是它自己的。这里没有任何东西复制真实设备。";
