"Decoys you're flying — one name per line. Fly them from their own tabs (the BLE beacon's name in Send, the GATT host in Serve); declare them here so the scoring knows what to look for in the attacker's hearing." = "你正在放飞的诱饵——每行一个名字。从它们自己的标签页放飞它们（发送标签页里的BLE信标名字，监听里也有伪装）；这是站点核对它们的清单。";
