"Estimated range" = "估计距离";
"Evening watch" = "傍晚守望";
"Every (seconds)" = "每（秒）";
"Every conversation and cadence note is deleted. The pairing key stays — the house forgets the conversations, not how to have them." = "每段对话和节奏记录都会被删除。配对密钥保留——房子忘记对话，不忘记秘密。";
"Every device in the list gets its own walk" = "列表中的每个设备都有自己的步行";
"Every device the house has learned — names, marks, drift and all — is forgotten, and their Map placements with them. The wire will populate its own cast again." = "每一个房子学到的设备——名称、标记、漂移等一切——都被遗忘，它们在地图上的位置也随之而去。";
"Every measure this app owns, announcing this one device at once. Nothing here touches anyone else's traffic." = "这个应用拥有的每种度量，一次宣告这一台设备。这里的任何东西都不碰别人的度量。";
"Every organ in the house, one continuous autonomous run: sweep the wire on every port in the rotation, let it announce itself, then knock — new and drifted devices get the full census, settled ones get their known doors re-asked — pass after pass, for as long as you leave it armed. Findings are named, not just counted: who arrived, who drifted, who answers, who went silent. Everything it learns walks the usual roads: the Neighborhood, the Map, the sealed log, the mind underneath." = "家里的每个器官，一次连续的自主运行：扫过轮换中的每个端口，让它自报家门，然后敲门——新设备和漂移的设备接受完整普查，安定的设备被重新询问它们已知的门——一遍又一遍，只要你让它保持布防。发现都有名字，而不只是计数：谁来了，谁漂移了，谁在回应，谁沉默了。它学到的一切都走寻常路：邻里、地图、封存的日志、下面的心智。";
"Every recorded session file is deleted. This cannot be undone." = "每个已录制的会话文件都会被删除。此操作无法撤销。";
"Every setting in this app has a sane default — the safe, legible choice — and the app runs on those defaults until you configure otherwise. A reset returns every setting to them, and forgets the setup mirror too, so the old configuration cannot restore itself later." = "此应用的每项设置都有一个合理的默认值——安全、清晰的选择——在您另行配置之前，应用都按这些默认值运行。重置会将每项设置恢复到这些值，并同时忘记配置镜像，这样旧配置之后就不能自行恢复。";
"Every setting returns to its sane default. EMCON stands down, the GATT host disarms, and stealth turns off. Payloads, presets, sessions and logs are not touched." = "每项设置都恢复到其合理的默认值。EMCON 解除，GATT 主机解除武装，隐身关闭。载荷、预设、会话和日志不受影响。";
"Every tab may wear its own. The Jolly Roger is the backdrop the app was born with — retired from default duty, never from the wardrobe. Your own art is copied into the app and never leaves this device; a GIF plays, a photograph holds still." = "每个标签页都可以穿自己的。骷髅旗是这个应用诞生时的背景——已从默认岗位退休，但仍挂在老地方。默认是表情符号，一点即可换到任何标签页。";
"Every tab, setting and switch — and Skelli herself, who answers in it too. Anything not yet translated shows in English, never blank. No fonts to install: the device's own fonts carry every script, at every size. Languages that read right to left turn the whole house with them." = "每个标签页、设置和开关——还有用它回答的斯凯利本人。尚未翻译的都以英文显示，永不空白。无需安装字体：设备自身的字体承载每种文字、每种字号。从右向左读的语言会带着整个房子一起转。";
"Everything here is fused from organs the app already has — Listen's hearing, the LAN census, the Night log. No new ears." = "这里的一切都是从应用已有的器官融合而来的——Listen 的听觉、局域网普查、夜之日志、Knocktalk 中继、进程板、每样东西上次被看到的记录。";
"Everything is where I left it. Good." = "一切都在我放的地方。很好。";
"Everything keeps working, quietly: this phone stops listing itself on the Wi-Fi (no Bonjour — reachable by IP address only), and arrivals slip into the inbox with no banners or sounds. BLE hosting must still advertise to be reachable; that is radio physics, not a setting." = "一切都在静静地继续工作：这部手机不再在 Wi-Fi 上列出自己（没有 Bonjour——可通过已知 IP 触及），到达的消息会落入收件箱，没有横幅也没有声音。";
"Everything she makes is filed here — take one, or zip the lot and take it all." = "她做的一切都保存在这里——拿一个，或者把全部打包带走。";
"Everything this phone can hear — the air, the wire, the Night log — in one registry, one timeline, recorded watches." = "这部手机能听到的一切——空气、线路、夜间日志——汇入一个登记册、一条时间线、记录在案的守望。";
"Export exchange history (.jsonl)" = "导出交换历史 (.jsonl)";
