"Night log" = "夜间日志";
"Night log — the whole instrument, one timeline" = "夜间日志——整个仪器，一条时间线";
"Night maneuvers" = "夜间机动";
"Night wire. The honest hours." = "夜之线。诚实的时辰。";
"Night. The wire and I have it." = "夜晚。电线和我掌握了它。";
"No Wi-Fi address on this phone" = "这部电话没有Wi-Fi地址";
"No address swept for this device yet — run a sweep on the Scan tab and its dossier gains a knock." = "尚未为此设备扫描任何地址——在扫描标签页上扫一遍，它的档案就会多一次敲门。";
"No backdrop in this build. The app looks for wallpaper.gif in the bundle (or a \"Wallpaper\" data asset) — and wears plain black until it finds one." = "此版本没有背景。应用会在包中寻找 wallpaper.gif（或“Wallpaper”数据资源）——找到之前一身素黑。";
"No captured bytes yet. When the tripwire catches a knock, its first words are kept — and become ammunition here: replayed, mutated, and fired at your own Serve to see what holds." = "尚无捕获的字节。当绊线逮住一次敲门，它的第一句话会被留存——并成为她的弹药。过几分钟再来看看。";
"No coin yet. Claim any NFC tag, or mint a blank one with the mark of the house." = "还没有硬币。声明任意 NFC 标签，或用房子的印记铸造一张空白的。";
"No conversations yet. Open one by address — the other phone needs the app, the same pairing key, and EMCON up." = "尚未有对话。按地址打开一个——另一部电话需要这个应用、相同的配对密钥，以及处于 Charlie 或更安静的 EMCON。";
"No decoded details — the broadcast carried nothing the decoders read." = "没有解码出的细节——广播里没有解码器能读的东西。";
"No drift — it answers exactly as baselined." = "没有漂移——它完全按照基准来回答。";
"No findings. Either the house is at peace, or the mind is still learning what peace looks like here." = "没有发现。要么房子安宁，要么心智还在学习这里的安宁是什么样。";
"No home subnet is marked, so there is no turf to learn." = "没有标记家庭子网，因此没有可学习的领地。";
"No key yet: Knocktalk seals with ChaCha20-Poly1305, and without the shared key nothing here can be sealed or opened." = "还没有密钥：Knocktalk 用 ChaCha20-Poly1305 封存，没有共享密钥，这里什么都封不了也开不了。";
"No lessons yet — the canary learns from whoever talks to it." = "还没有教训——金丝雀向跟它说话的人学习。";
"No macros yet. Build one block by block below, start from a template, or tell Skelli the steps — she builds them too." = "尚无宏。在下面逐块构建一个，从模板开始，或把步骤告诉 Skelli——她来构建。";
"No nearby phones right now — start serving on another phone on this Wi-Fi and it appears here, or type an address." = "现在附近没有电话——在另一台电话上开始在这个 Wi-Fi 上服务，它就会出现在这里，或者输入一个地址。";
"No neighbors yet. Run a sweep, let Bonjour resolve, or simply be knocked — the wire will populate its own cast." = "还没有邻居。跑一次扫掠，让Bonjour解析，或者干脆被敲一下——线会按自己的节奏填充它。";
"No probers yet. When something knocks, its file opens here." = "还没有窥探者。当有东西敲门时，它的档案会在这里打开。";
"No rendezvous yet" = "尚未汇合";
"No sessions yet. Start one on the Listen tab; each session becomes a .jsonl file you can share to the Mac and feed to `nightjar report` and `nightjar trackers`." = "尚无会话。在聆听标签页开始一个；每个会话都会成为一个 .jsonl 文件，可以共享到 Mac 并喂给 `nightjar report` 和 `nightjar trackers`。";
"No." = "不行。";
"No. Doesn't parse — and I'm not in the mood to guess. Shorter." = "不行。解析不了——而且我没心情猜。短一点。";
"Nobody has knocked. When someone runs these probes against this phone, it lands here — source, port, and which first words they used. The log persists across launches. The tripwire never replies." = "没有人敲过门。当有人对这部电话运行这些探针时，它就会落在这里——来源、端口以及载荷本身。";
"None" = "无";
"None — black" = "无——黑色";
"Not heard advertising under this name. (Listen matches by name only — a name is a claim, not an identity.)" = "没有听到它以这个名字自报家门。（Listen 仅按名字匹配——名字是主张，不是身份。）";
"Not heard in this session yet. It may be asleep, out of range — or, if it rotates its address, gone under a new one." = "本次会话尚未听到。它可能睡着了、超出范围——或者，如果它在轮换地址，已经换了个新名字消失了。";
"Not in earshot this session — the placement is kept for its return." = "本次会话不在耳边——放置点保留到它返回时。";
"Not now" = "暂不";
"Not on Wi-Fi — join a network and the recon tools wake up." = "不在 Wi-Fi 上——加入网络，侦察工具就会醒来。";
"Not ready" = "未就绪";
"Not serving — the ring is down" = "未在服务——环已落下";
"Not so" = "并非如此";
"Not yet" = "尚未";
"Note — what this playlist is for" = "备注——这个播放列表是干什么的";
"Noted." = "已记录。";
"Noted. Thrilling." = "注意到了。太刺激了。";
"Nothing answered on any probed port, on loopback or the LAN address. From out there, this device is a rumor." = "任何被探测的端口上，环回或局域网地址上，都没有回应。从外面看，这台设备是一个空楼层：它的名字不在任何人的mDNS表里。";
"Nothing answered on those ports." = "那些端口上什么都没有回应。";
"Nothing filed yet. What she forges and builds lands here." = "尚无存档。她锻造和构建的东西会落在这里。";
"Nothing fresh in the air. The ear wakes in Listen." = "空气中没有新鲜的。耳朵在 Listen 中醒来。";
"Nothing heard yet in this epoch. Start Listen, run a trace or a War Room operation — the registry fills from what the organs hear." = "这个纪元里尚未听到任何东西。启动 Listen，运行一次跟踪或一次作战室操作——注册表会从中充实起来。";
"Nothing in the log answers that — and it would rather say so than invent." = "日志里没有任何东西回答这个问题——而且它宁愿这么说也不愿意编造。";
"Nothing is running, and nothing has finished lately — the house is quiet." = "什么都没在运行，最近也没有什么结束——房子很安静。";
"Nothing journaled yet. Serve arrivals, tripwire knocks, EMCON posture changes, sparring runs and listening-session bounds land here as one timeline — the whole instrument, one night at a time." = "日志里还什么都没有。Serve 的到达、绊线的敲门、EMCON 的姿态变化、陪练的运行和聆听会话的边界都会以一条时间线的形式落在这里——整台仪器，一夜一夜地。";
"Nothing off-pattern tonight." = "今晚没有偏离模式的。";
"Nothing open." = "没有开放的。";
"Nothing received yet." = "尚未收到任何东西。";
"Nothing sealed or structured has knocked. A scan sweeps; anything that spells — and fails to open — lands here." = "没有任何密封或结构化的东西敲击过。一次扫描扫过；任何会拼写的——并且无法打开的——都会掉落在这里，未经解码且完好，旅程标记完好。";
"Nothing survived the drill. The second scan found a clean device." = "什么都没能熬过演习。第二次扫描发现了一台干净的设备。";
"Nothing went quiet." = "什么都没有安静下来。";
"Nothing yet — sends, replies, and listener events land here." = "尚无内容——发送、回复和监听事件会落在这里。";
"Nothing yet. As the record deepens, the mind writes down what it concludes — quiet hours, a regular's rhythm, two who stir together — and keeps it here." = "尚无内容。随着记录加深，心智会写下它的结论——安静时段、常客的节奏、某样东西一直选择的名字、模式破裂的那一周。";
"Nothing yet. The first message knocks the whole conversation open — fragments, about twelve seconds each, and the other phone knocks its ACK back the same way." = "尚无。每条第一条消息都会敲开整段对话——碎片，每片约十二秒，按敲击编号。";
"Now" = "现在";
"Now running" = "正在运行";
"OK" = "OK";
"OPTIONS" = "OPTIONS";
"OVERDUE — the hand falls at the next opening." = "已逾期——手将在下一次打开时落下。";
"Observation feed" = "观察馈送";
"Observe" = "观察";
"Off home turf — this network is not your marked home. Going dark is advised." = "离开主场——这个网络不是你标记的家。建议隐入黑暗。";
"Off stills every GIF in the house: the boot film and the splashes stand on their first frame, and the wallpaper reel holds still. Nothing is removed — the pictures stay, the motion goes." = "关闭会静止家里的每个 GIF：启动影片和飞溅画面停在第一帧，壁纸卷轴保持静止。什么都不会被移除——画面还在，运动消失。";
"Offer the duel" = "提出决斗";
"Oh good. Company." = "哦好。有伴了。";
"Old enough to know better. Young enough to knock anyway." = "年纪大到知道更好。年轻到照样去敲。";
"On the air. Holders of this key, listening now, can see it." = "在空中。持有此密钥的人，现在正在倾听，可以看到它。";
"On the board" = "在棋盘上";
"On the wire" = "在线路上";
"On this Wi-Fi · Bonjour" = "在此 Wi-Fi 上 · Bonjour";
"One 256-bit key, both phones, kept in the Keychain. Generate it on one phone and carry it to the other — or paste the one it made." = "一个 256 位的密钥，两部电话，保存在钥匙串中。在一部电话上生成并带到另一部——或者粘贴一个你已经共享的密钥。";
"One JSON: this timeline, the knock record, and the trace's own export embedded whole." = "一个 JSON：这条时间线、敲门记录，以及跟踪自己的导出，完整嵌入。";
"One choice, now — the whole house speaks it, Skelli included. Change it any time in About." = "现在，一个选择——整个房子都说它，包括斯凯利。随时在“关于”里更改。";
"One drill tests a wall; a season tests the watch. The ghost visits while the instrument is awake — a closed app has no ears, and the season does not pretend otherwise." = "一次演习测试一堵墙；一个赛季测试警戒。幽灵在仪器清醒时造访——凌晨 1 点到 4 点关闭的窗户不是承诺，而是一种概率，并且季节会诚实地说明哪些访问确实发生了。";
"One of these names is a lie. I intend to find which." = "这些名字里有一个是谎言。我打算查出是哪一个。";
"One operation: Listen (if the air is included) and the trace run as one, then the knock bench works every door the trace confirmed — all of it on one timeline, all of it in one export." = "一次操作：Listen（如果包括空气）和追踪作为一体运行，然后敲门台敲遍追踪确认的每一扇门——全在一条时间线上，全在一份导出中。";
"One page per device, every organ's testimony: what Scan heard, whether Listen has heard the name over Bluetooth, and a Recon knock on demand." = "每台设备一页，每个器官的证词：Scan 听到了什么，Listen 是否通过蓝牙听过这个名字，Neighborhood 是否见过它的形状。";
"One payload, a whole list of targets — typed, pasted, imported from a file, or harvested from the network by the Scan tab." = "一个载荷、一整列目标——输入、粘贴、从文件导入，或从网络本身收获（最近一次线路扫掠的每个开放地址、网络中保留的每次监听）。";
"One phone defends (Serve up, decoys flying), the other attacks (trace and knock). The match protocol rides the Serve inbox, and the scoring diffs what was found against what was run and caught." = "一部电话防御（Serve 升起，诱饵飞舞），另一部进攻（跟踪和敲门）。对局协议在房子自己的皮肤中旅行：第一记敲门上有个封存的 NJCR 信封，中途有言语陷阱，最后有个封存的裁决。";
"One phone is the ground, the other the blade: three rounds of strikes against its real surface, refereed by its own event log." = "一部电话是土地，另一部是刀刃：针对其真实表面进行三轮打击，由两台电话携带的解码器裁判。交换加密的身份令牌；原始身份在每个设备上保存并密封，用于档案——而不是放在服务器上。";
"One tap: full knock and Bonjour audit, then EMCON engages, then both run again and the difference is read out here." = "一点：完整的敲击和Bonjour审计，然后EMCON启动，然后两者再次运行，差值就是报告。";
