"The gate stands at every funnel: under a condition, a forbidden organ cannot start — not by hand, not by macro, not by her, not by a saved arm returning at launch. Refusals are journaled. A single payload you fire yourself is you speaking, and is not regulated; everything that stands, advertises, serves, probes or polls is." = "大门立在每个漏斗口：在一种条件下，被禁止的器官无法启动——不能用手，不能用其他机制，不能用录制的宏。";
"The ghost is at the door…" = "幽灵就在门口…";
"The grind" = "研磨";
"The house is lit. Anyone can see us. I don't mind — much." = "房子是亮的。任何人都能看到我们。我不在意——没那么在意。";
"The house, indexed" = "房子索引";
"The hunt needs live ears." = "狩猎需要活着的耳朵。";
"The instrument reports for duty: the seal chain proves the record, the census reads the posture, the spar fires sixty mutations of a real capture at your own Serve. The grade goes into the sealed log either way." = "该仪器报告值班情况：密封链证明记录，人口普查读取姿势，哨兵的邮件带回确认，季节的幽灵还有很多夜晚要运行。";
"The last twelve hours, distilled from the sealed log below — counts and headlines; the proof stays in the ledger." = "过去十二小时，从下面封印的日志蒸馏而来——计数和标题；证据留在现场笔记里。";
