"The living wallpaper has not landed in this build — the retired Jolly Roger stands in behind every tab until wallpaper.gif joins the bundle." = "动态壁纸尚未进入此版本——在 wallpaper.gif 加入包之前，退役的海盗旗会站在每个标签页背后代班。";
"The loop fires only at this device: the target is loopback, and the mutations are of traffic this phone actually received." = "循环只向这台设备开火：目标是环回，变异来自这部电话已经在服务的流量。";
"The measures" = "措施";
"The mind's only memory of itself: which drift it has already reckoned, your verdicts on its findings, and the facts it has learned." = "心智对自己唯一的记忆：它已经计算过哪些漂移，你对它发现的裁決——在那薄薄的证据上，整合慢慢锻造出关于你和这个网络的论断。这些都不离开电话。";
"The mind, watching: %@" = "心智，注视着：%@";
"The mirror — what the wire calls you" = "镜子——线路怎么称呼你";
"The morning brief" = "晨间简报";
"The name of this ear, written into every session. The Mac's fusion uses it to tell your phone apart from your other posts — give each one its own name." = "这只耳朵的名字，会写入每个会话。Mac 的融合功能用它来区分您的手机和其他哨所——给每个哨所起个自己的名字。";
"The names and shapes this device wears: costumes for the air, and mimicry personas that dress the whole device as a class of thing — or as the network's own gear, access point included — until you drop the shape." = "这台设备所穿戴的名字和形状：给空气的伪装，以及给整个表面穿上服装的模仿人格——蓝牙地址、名字说法、邻居表。";
"The network gear is worn where an app can wear it — the air name, the listeners, the replies, a listed posture. iOS lets no app broadcast an SSID, so there is no fake radio here: the access point is a shape on the wire, not a transmitter." = "网络设备被穿在应用程序可以穿的地方——空中名称、侦听器、回复、可以打开的列出端口。SSID 无法广播——没有 iOS 应用程序可以充当接入点。";
"The night, understood" = "夜晚，被理解";
"The opposite of everything on this tab: Serve listed, stealth off, the beacon shouting, Net-Assault armed, a broadcast heartbeat — this device announcing itself at full voice until you cease it. Ceasing restores the posture it found." = "此标签页上一切的反面：Serve 上市、潜行关闭、信标呼喊、Net-Assault 布防、广播心跳——这台设备以全声自我宣告，直到你让它停止。停止后会恢复它找到的姿态。";
"The pairing key decides what opens. Cadence decides what is believed: the seal learns a peer's knock timing from its first messages, then flags any later message that arrives in foreign hands — right key, wrong rhythm. It never blocks a message; it marks it, and the night log remembers." = "配对密钥决定什么能打开。节奏决定什么被相信：封印从那次对话中学习对方的敲击时机。互相催促的人更难分辨。启用锁定后，三次失败就关门，但人的敲门不如快速的对方熟练。让你自己双手的敲击做封印的老师。";
"The pattern held. Nothing in the house broke it." = "模式保持住了。房子里没有什么打破它。";
"The payload rides in service data for FFF0 — the slot iOS lets an app set. Foreground only, and small: keep it under ~20 bytes." = "载荷在 FFF0 的服务数据中旅行——这是 iOS 允许应用设置的那个位置。仅在前台，且很小：保持简短。";
"The perimeter tightens itself for thirty minutes when a foreign nightjar-grade probe speaks to it, or a honeydrop is taken: answer in character arms whether or not its switch is set. Nothing else changes — a tightened perimeter stays legible." = "当外国 nightjar 级探测器与 perimeter 对话时，或戴着手套的手敲击正门时，perimeter 会在三十分钟内自动收紧。操作员已被通知；软化是手动的。";
