"The same sealed box as a knock, sung as tones: speaker to microphone, no network, no radio — it works in airplane mode. Short messages only (sound is a narrow pipe), and keep this tab open while listening. Heard chirps land in a thread named chirp." = "与敲击相同的封存盒子，用音调唱出：扬声器对麦克风，没有网络，没有无线电——在屏蔽的房间里也能工作。";
"The sealed box as a looping sequence of QR frames — for the room where even a chirp is too loud. The camera gathers frames until the set is whole; the loop forgives every miss. One-way, like sound: no acknowledgement rides the light back." = "将密封的盒子作为 QR 帧的循环序列——适用于连唧唧声都太大的房间。相机是耳朵；屏幕是嘴。";
