"The shape" = "形态";
"The station's limits, in its own words: no spectrum beyond Bluetooth is available to any iOS app; Wi-Fi is visible only as the joined network plus what the census builds by knocking; identities are as emitters claim them, per channel, per epoch. Receive and observe — the station never interferes with the spectrum it watches." = "该站以自己的话说明其极限：任何 iOS 应用都无法获得蓝牙之外的频谱；Wi-Fi 对 iOS 而言以总量可见，以帧则不可见；扫描遵循 iOS 的节奏，其反复无常塑造了结果。";
