"The timing fingerprints learned for every peer are deleted. Cadence learns each hand again from its next knocks." = "为每个对等方学到的时序指纹被删除。节奏从每个手的裸节奏重新学习。";
"The transcript goes. What she remembers stays — forgetting that is its own act, under Reset." = "记录会消失。她记得的会留下——忘记那些是另一回事，在“重置”里。";
"The whole house in your language — every tab, setting and switch, and Skelli herself — the moment you choose it, with no relaunch. The room behind this door lists every tongue by its own name, shows the one in force, and turns the house for the languages that read right to left." = "整个房子用你的语言——每个标签页、设置和开关，还有斯凯利本人——在你选择的瞬间，无需重新启动。这扇门后的房间按每种语言自己的名字列出它们，显示正在生效的那个，并为从右向左读的语言转动房子。";
"The whole house in your language — every tab, setting and switch, the moment you choose it, with no relaunch. Anything not yet translated shows in English, never blank. The app draws with your device's fonts, so every script renders natively." = "整座房子都用您的语言——每个标签页、设置和开关，在您选择的瞬间生效，无需重启。尚未翻译的内容以英文显示，永不空白。应用使用您设备的字体绘制，因此每种文字都原生呈现。";
