"This advertiser rotates its address — if it goes quiet mid-hunt, it may have stepped sideways into a new identity rather than away." = "这个广播者在轮换它的地址——如果它在狩猎中途沉默，它可能已经侧身闪进了一个新地址。";
"This build's signing doesn't carry the HealthKit entitlement, so the instrument sleeps — the way the Coin sleeps under free signing. A signing that carries it wakes the instrument with no other change." = "此版本的签名不带有 HealthKit 授权，因此仪器处于睡眠状态——就像当标签 API 不存在时，硬币插头会转移视线一样。";
