"This is loud. It announces this phone to every device — and every watcher — on the wire. On networks you do not own it may trip intrusion detection, alerts, and logs with your name on them." = "这很吵。它向线上的每台设备——以及每个观察者——宣告这部电话。在不属于你的网络上，敲门的答复会落在这里。";
"This is meant to be noticed — by every admin measure on the network: the DHCP and flow logs, the controller's client list, anything watching broadcasts. On a network you do not own, expect exactly the attention it asks for." = "这是为了被人注意到——被网络上的每一个管理指标：DHCP 和流量日志、控制器的会话表、看着仪表上升的 NMS。";
"This is nightjar-hack: the listening post from nightjar, plus a mouth. The Listen tab is the purist half — it scans and logs advertisements and never connects, pairs or sends, exactly like the upstream app. The Send and Serve tabs are the hack half: they transmit, but only when you press their buttons, to targets you type. The two halves share no radio state; the ear stays pure, the mouth is a " = "这是 nightjar-hack：nightjar 的聆听哨所，加上一张嘴。聆听标签页是纯粹派的一半——它扫描并记录广播，从不连接、配对或发送，与上游应用完全一样。发送和服务标签页是黑客的一半：它们会发射，但只在您按下按钮时，指向您输入的目标。两半不共享无线电状态；耳朵保持纯粹，嘴则是一个";
