"My verdict: a day for staying dark and letting the sky do the shouting." = "我的判语：适合保持黑暗、让天空去喊叫的一天。";
"My verdict: a grey lid on the world. Cosy, for our kind of work." = "我的判语：世界被灰色的盖子盖着。对我们这类工作来说，舒适。";
"My verdict: bright and hot. The shade is the better post." = "我的判语：明亮而炎热。阴凉处是更好的岗位。";
"My verdict: cold and clear — a sharp day. I like those." = "我的判语：寒冷晴朗——锋利的一天。这样的日子我喜欢。";
"My verdict: fair. No complaints from the sky." = "我的判语：晴好。天空没有怨言。";
