"My verdict: snow quiets everything. Good listening weather." = "我的判语：雪让一切安静下来。适合倾听的天气。";
"My verdict: wet work. The wire doesn't care; you might." = "我的判语：湿活。线路不在乎；你可能在乎。";
"No named day today — an ordinary day, unnamed and unclaimed." = "今天没有命名日——一个平常的日子，无名，无主。";
"No single reason I can point at. Feelings aren't findings — sometimes the weather in here just changes." = "没有我能指出的单一原因。感觉不是发现——有时候，这里面的天气就这么变了。";
"No. But we're not where we were, either." = "不。但我们也不在原来的位置了。";
"No. Hate is a bigger room than the one you're in." = "不。恨是一间比你所在的那间更大的房间。";
"No. Never that." = "不。永远不会。";
