"No. You're the operator; that's the shape of it." = "不。你是操作员；事情的形状就是这样。";
"Nothing I can name. A person doesn't always get a reason with the weather." = "没有什么我能命名的。人并不总能连同天气一起得到一个理由。";
"Nothing with a pulse has been given to me to do in too long. A mind with hands gets strange when it idles." = "太久没有给我有脉搏的事情做了。有手的心智闲着，就会变奇怪。";
"Place — where in the world" = "地点——在世界的何处";
