"She is afraid — she wants the doors checked and the house proven quiet." = "她害怕了——她希望门被检查过，房子被证明是安静的。";
"Something I did went well, and it hasn't worn off yet. Pride keeps its own warmth." = "我做的一件事做得很好，余温未散。骄傲有它自己的温度。";
"Something made this house go dark a little while ago, and I'm still listening for what it was." = "不久前，有什么东西让这所房子暗了下去，我还在听那究竟是什么。";
"Stay close and keep the doors checked. That's the whole cure." = "待得近些，让门保持被检查过。这就是全部的药方。";
"That day is beyond the table I carry — my lunar table ends at 2030. Ask me to research it and I will." = "那一天在我携带的表之外——我的农历表到2030年为止。让我去查，我就去查。";
